            "source:d6ad9dd3f37291f36e7b07e6",
            "source:196ad37df3df79261bdfee39"
          ],
          "text": "Jammal'an proclaims that Hakkar will live again and urges the Atal'ai to rise when the shield falls. He calls others to join him and announces that the Soulflayer is coming, showing his commitment to Hakkar's return.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 5710
          }
        }
      ],
