    {
      "entry": 5717,
      "name": "Mijan",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:5717:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:672fa567d93572e8eb4784b6",
            "source:d8a72b9db7fa13b870cce7b5",
            "source:9fe77a38cf5ff05d77c2a6b3",
            "source:e0cbc96a4b912604b9caa5d6",
            "source:51081c322e65cd39a73a2e25"
          ],
          "text": "Mijan is a troll guardian of the Sunken Temple, named alongside Gasher, Zolo, Hukku, Zul'lor, and Loro as a source of voodoo feathers. Bath'rah, the Fallen Hero of the Horde, and another quest giver all identify the group as targets for their feather-gathering plans. In combat, Mijan uses Thorns Aura and a Healing Ward.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 5717
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 5719,
      "name": "Morphaz",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:5719:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:7741a2ca3af7e9a3da46aaf7",
            "source:09ba59f554b149d238d81657",
            "source:d687cabb70fd595af744ab86"
          ],
          "text": "Morphaz is a green drake dwelling deep in the Sunken Temple of Atal'Hakkar. Archmage Xylem says Morphaz killed and devoured his apprentice during an ambush years ago; the apprentice carried a valuable arcane shard. Greta Mosshoof's account calls Morphaz immune to poison and disease, based on information gathered at the cost of many druids' lives. Other hunters also seek the drake, whom Ogtinc describes as an enemy of many.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 5719
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "entry": 5720,
      "name": "Weaver",
