            "source:b781c14e5cd1a8d86270a38c",
            "source:6184e3c43c6b74af766bc16f"
          ],
          "text": "Atal'alarion is the Guardian of the Idol, a named figure who, when released from banishment, greets his release with “Let the blood flow!” and threatens to feast on his opponents' bones; his combat style includes Sweeping Slam and Ground Tremor.",
