            "source:77a971867360a4433a2258e1",
            "source:2ac5b2c51f1a92b5f5594e40"
          ],
          "text": "Elder Starsong is an Elder tied to a sky-centered observance. Her guidance looks to the heavens for earthly answers and describes the stars of this age as beacons of hope and strength. Her dialogue connects her to fellow Elders Bellowrage, Starglade, Skychaser, and Stormbrow through questions about their whereabouts.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 15593
          }
